# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Greensleeves|绿袖子
artist: English Folk Song|英国民谣
bpm: 80
time: 3/4
level: 3
desc: The main melody (first part) of the famous English folk song, A minor, 3/4 time. It has many dotted rhythms and sharps (G# on string 3 fret 1, F# on string 4 fret 4).|著名的英国民谣主旋律 (第一段), A 小调, 三拍子. 有很多附点节奏和升号音 (G# 在 3弦1品, F# 在 4弦4品).
desc: Tip: dotted quarter + eighth = one and a half beats + half a beat; count "1 - 2 and 3".|小贴士: 附点四分音符 + 八分音符 = 一拍半 + 半拍, 数 "1 - 2 嗒 3".
